;Description
:This template is used to link to a Twitch account.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Twitch|<username>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Twitch Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Twitch|rnroi29|mafumafu Twitch description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Twitch|rnroi29|forte twitch description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

